---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>About — Olivia Sloth</title>
	</head>

	<body>

		<header>
			<a class="name" href="/">OLIVIA SLOTH</a>

			<nav>
				<a href="/stories">Stories</a>
				<a href="/talks">Talks</a>
				<a class="active" href="/about">About</a>
			</nav>
		</header>


		<main>

			<!-- INTRO -->

			<section class="intro">

				<div class="intro-text">
					<p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>

					<h1>Hi, I’m Olivia.</h1>

					<p class="lead">
						I’m a physicist who somehow ended up spending a lot of my time
						walking up mountains, travelling alone and getting invited into
						the homes of people I’ve only just met.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="intro-image">
					<img src="/tur2.JPEG" alt="Olivia Sloth" />
				</div>

			</section>


			<!-- STORY -->

			<section class="story">

				<p class="eyebrow">HOW I ENDED UP HERE</p>

				<div class="story-text">

					<p>
						I’m from Denmark and have a PhD in physics. For years,
						adventure was something I did alongside a fairly conventional
						career.
					</p>

					<p>
						Outside work, I kept finding reasons to go somewhere else.
						I’ve hiked alone in Iran, travelled through Iraqi Kurdistan,
						Lebanon and Syria, slept in caves, climbed mountains and spent
						a lot of time with people whose lives look very different from
						my own.
					</p>

					<p>
						Somewhere along the way, travelling stopped being something
						I wanted to squeeze into my holidays.
					</p>

					<p>
						In 2026, I left my job to give it more space.
					</p>

				</div>

			</section>


			<!-- FACTS -->

			<section class="facts">

				<p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS ABOUT ME</p>

				<div class="fact-grid">

					<div class="fact">
						<span>01</span>
						<p>PhD in physics</p>
					</div>

					<div class="fact">
						<span>02</span>
						<p>Solo hiker</p>
					</div>

					<div class="fact">
						<span>03</span>
						<p>Usually carrying too much coffee</p>
					</div>

					<div class="fact">
						<span>04</span>
						<p>Learning Arabic — slowly</p>
					</div>

					<div class="fact">
						<span>05</span>
						<p>Happiest somewhere in the mountains</p>
					</div>

					<div class="fact">
						<span>06</span>
						<p>Not particularly good at choosing the easy option</p>
					</div>

				</div>

			</section>


			<!-- CONTACT -->

			<section class="contact">

				<p class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</p>

				<h2>
					Want to work together, book a talk or just say hi?
				</h2>

				<a href="mailto:oliviasloth@hotmail.com">
					Get in touch →
				</a>

			</section>

		</main>

	</body>
</html>


<style>

	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	html,
	body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		background: #f4f1ea;
		color: #171717;
	}

	body {
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
	}

	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}


	/* HEADER */

	header {
		padding: 30px 48px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.name {
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 32px;
	}

	nav a {
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	nav .active {
		border-bottom: 1px solid #171717;
	}


	/* INTRO */

	.intro {
		max-width: 1400px;
		margin: 90px auto 150px;
		padding: 0 48px;

		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr;
		gap: 90px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 24px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(70px, 8vw, 125px);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 0.92;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.lead {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 45px 0 0;

		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(25px, 2.4vw, 34px);
		line-height: 1.45;
		color: #555;
	}

	.intro-image img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
	}


	/* STORY */

	.story {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 48px 150px;
	}

	.story-text {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin-left: auto;
	}

	.story-text p {
		margin: 0 0 32px;

		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: 22px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}


	/* FACTS */

	.facts {
		max-width: 1400px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 80px 48px 120px;
		border-top: 1px solid #b9b3a9;
	}

	.fact-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		margin-top: 50px;
	}

	.fact {
		padding: 35px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid #c8c2b8;

		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.fact:nth-child(odd) {
		padding-right: 50px;
	}

	.fact:nth-child(even) {
		padding-left: 50px;
	}

	.fact span {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #777;
	}

	.fact p {
		margin: 0;

		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(24px, 2.2vw, 34px);
		line-height: 1.2;
	}


	/* CONTACT */

	.contact {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 100px 48px 140px;
	}

	.contact h2 {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 0 40px;

		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 72px);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.05;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}

	.contact a {
		display: inline-block;
		font-weight: 700;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #171717;
		padding-bottom: 4px;
	}


	/* MOBILE */

	@media (max-width: 800px) {

		header {
			padding: 24px 20px;
		}

		.name {
			font-size: 17px;
		}

		nav {
			gap: 14px;
		}

		nav a {
			font-size: 13px;
		}


		.intro {
			margin: 60px auto 100px;
			padding: 0 24px;

			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 50px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 64px;
		}

		.lead {
			font-size: 24px;
		}

		.intro-image {
			order: -1;
		}


		.story {
			padding: 0 24px 100px;
		}

		.story-text p {
			font-size: 19px;
		}


		.facts {
			padding: 60px 24px 90px;
		}

		.fact-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.fact:nth-child(odd),
		.fact:nth-child(even) {
			padding: 28px 0;
		}

		.fact p {
			font-size: 25px;
		}


		.contact {
			padding: 70px 24px 100px;
		}

		.contact h2 {
			font-size: 44px;
		}
	}

</style>